terior design. ItΓÇÖs made from silica, soda ash, and limestone, and offers benefits like natural light transmission, insulation, and aesthetic appeal.'),(12,'Clay','A natural earthy material that hardens when fired, used in making bricks, tiles, and ceramics for construction and decoration.'),(13,'Stone','A naturally occurring solid material, used for building structures, walls, and decorative elements, prized for its durability and aesthetic qualities.');
